{"id": "68304", "title": "[重生]私人中医", "author": "缺氧的金鱼", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 34, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68304.htm", "intro": "——上尉，我是医生不是开食堂的。\r\n\r\n上辈子张远就像扫把星转世，命运多舛，所以不堪重负的他早早就去了。却没想到老天爷给他一个重来的机会，但他担心摆脱不了扫把星附身一般的命运。\r\n\r\n别人总说廖安和感情有缺陷，眼里只有事业，不近人情。要不是有他家老爷子，他这种人早就下台了。更别说升职了，那简直是痴人说梦。但是他从来不这么认为，所以依然我行我素。\r\n\r\n可是为什么小孩子都能翻过去的墙，自己翻过去就骨折了呢？骨折就骨折吧，可是到最后他怎么就被一个温柔体贴的好男人保养了呢？不对，不是包养，他只是搭火而已，谁让他做的东西即营养又好吃。再次申明我绝对没被包养，我也不是吃货。\r\n1V1 [主攻文，不喜慎入] 本文半架空，请勿对号入坐\r\n【~~~~(>_", "base": "files/article/html/68/68304", "chapters": [{"title": "001", "file": "10524741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002", "file": "10524742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003", "file": "10524743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "004", "file": "10524744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005", "file": "10524745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006", "file": "10524746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007", "file": "10524747.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008", "file": "10524748.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009", "file": "10524749.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010", "file": "10524750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011", "file": "10524751.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012", "file": "10524752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013", "file": "10524753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014", "file": "10524754.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015", "file": "10524755.html", "available": false}, {"title": "016", "file": "10524756.html", "available": false}, {"title": "017", "file": "10524757.html", "available": false}, {"title": "018", "file": "10524758.html", "available": false}, {"title": "019", "file": "10524759.html", "available": false}, {"title": "020", "file": "10524760.html", "available": false}, {"title": "021", "file": "10524761.html", "available": false}, {"title": "022", "file": "10524762.html", "available": false}, {"title": "023", "file": "105